74357, "avatar": "01f2dfc94a723c0a743851ea889ae78cad9a106a"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is very fun, lots of random things happening, challenges to complete, items to unlock, landscapes to explore! This game overall is a fun game with a flaws and the biggets flaw that I see it multipalyer. This game has a multiplayer feature but it requires a lot to set up and play with friends. Once you get it set up the connection is never strong and can be very choppy. The landscapes only have a few variations, but the death scenes are hilarious and if you can over come laggy multiplayer, you can have major fun with an infinte amount of friends! (that seems to crash the game) But overall it is money well spent and an amazing game for a pretty low price!", "timestamp_created": 1490158368, "timestamp_updated": 1490158368, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}